{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1494896-monster-mash-21-22-final-round","id":1494896,"title":"Monster Mash 21/22 - Final Round","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-12T19:20:05-07:00","id":1494896,"title":"Monster Mash 21/22 - Final Round","content":"Bit bogged down under work and my Master's right now, but I'll stick the final poll up and hopefully get some more stuff out to you over the weekend. For Promethean, here are the options!<br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">A) Qashmal</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">B) Alchemist</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">C) Centimani</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">D) Pandoran</span></span><br /> <br /> Vote away! But as a thank you for sticking around this long (and because I love my Prometheans) here is a bonus mystery cult!<br /> <br /> <u><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Galvanic Disciples</span></b></u><br /> <br /> The Disciples have been around ever since Galvani and Volta founded the field of electrochemistry. Their own (somewhat questionable) histories say they were founded by Napoleon to apply this new science to occult threats to the nation. The Empire fell, but the Galvanic Disciples survived, fleeing to Russia, Prussia, Britain, and America. Each cell bears a stolen piece of a Promethean\u2019s body, suspended in a saline solution that makes it crackle with electricity and flare with illusionary Divine Fire.<br /> <br /> The Disciples seek to understand the Principle and Azoth that drives Prometheans, believing it to be a sentient force manifested in all electricity. Most cultists aren\u2019t proper Alchemists but scientists who delved too deep into the interplay between life and lightning. A good number are also amateur scientists without the formal training to recognize they are dabbling in the occult and pseudoscientific before it is far too late.<br /> <br /> Prometheans do their best to stay away from the Disciples, who become possessive and demanding when they suffer Disquiet. The cult is rarely hostile to the Created so that they can serve as useful allies in a pinch, but throngs need to be wary of letting them get too close. While the Disciples understand more than most mortals, they are still fundamentally meddling in forces they don\u2019t understand and frequently underestimate. More than one Disciple has lost their life intentionally trying to trigger a Firestorm they thought they could control.<br /> <br /> Mystery Cult Status<br /> <br /> \u25cf Every member of the Disciples is versed in hymns of current and voltage. The cultist gains a Science Specialization in Electricity.<br /> \u25cf\u25cf Understanding how electricity interacts with the living and the dead requires dissections, vivisections, and many, many corpses, human and animal alike. She gains the Tolerance For Biology Merit.<br /> \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf Long study of electricity and Azoth has partially attuned the scientist to Azothic Memory. She gains the Automatic Writing Merit.<br /> \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf Through the study of electrophysiology and with controlled electrical pulses, the researcher can alter her own body\u2019s properties. She gains three dots in the Biokinesis Merit.<br /> \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf Through years of research and experimentation, the cultist has attuned herself to the electrical signals of others around her. She gains the Aura Reading Merit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-12T20:13:52-07:00","id":1494899,"title":"","content":"C) Centimani - Always Centimani... \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-12T20:14:35-07:00","id":1494900,"title":"","content":"It's been enough time and tide that I feel warmer a